Step 1: Install Node.js
If you haven't installed Node.js yet:

Go to the official Node.js Website.
https://nodejs.org/en
Download and run the LTS (Long Term Support) installer.

Important for Windows users: Make sure to go through the installer steps and check the option that says "Automatically install the necessary tools" or ensure "Add to PATH" is enabled.
npm install
node -v
npm -v
npm install -g @angular/cli

