Method 1: Allow PowerShell Scripts (Recommended)You can update your PowerShell execution policy for your user account so it allows running scripts:
Open PowerShell.
Run the following command:PowerShell
Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser

